  <readme><![CDATA[
# ChatGPT

OpenAI's flagship chat web UI at [chatgpt.com](https://chatgpt.com).
The bridge drives the logged-in browser session — no per-token API
fees, your existing Plus/Pro subscription is the rate limiter.

**Models typically exposed** (subject to discovery on first login):

  - GPT-5
  - GPT-4o
  - o3 / o3-mini (reasoning)
  - GPT-4.1

Core provider — preinstalled and required for the extension to ship
a working out-of-box experience. Cannot be uninstalled from the
provider marketplace.
  ]]></readme>

